OL,3,GNEWSAGroup making flat-pack community
OL,4,Ahall from plywood
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers are hard at work creating a
OL,7,Fso-called flat-pack community hall made
OL,8,Fwith an entirely plywood frame.
OL,10,FThe Ford Park Community Group in
OL,11,FUlverston want a new environmentally
OL,12,Ffriendly community room for hosting
OL,13,Flocal groups, events and classes in the
OL,14,Fcharity-run park.
OL,16,FThe building will take just four and a
OL,17,Fhalf weeks to create because the
OL,18,Fproject uses specially made pieces of
OL,19,Fplywood, cut by local manufacturer
OL,20,FDigital Woodoo, which then all slot
OL,21,Ftogether easily.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
