OL,3,GNEWSAGroup making flat-pack community
OL,4,Ahall from plywood
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director at Digital Woodoo, James
OL,7,FRobinson, said it the "unconventional
OL,8,Fdesign" means anyone can be part of the
OL,9,Fbuild, creating a "very democratic
OL,10,Fapproach to construction".
